<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "SE\pipipi.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "0" "100"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\天井.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Dazzling light was pouring into my eyeballs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The brightness sent a stabbing pain deep in my eyes, and my eyelids grew heavy on their own.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Oh, she's awake!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A voice I knew―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
　Where am I? My head was pounding, and the skin all over my body stung.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Mooom! </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> opened her eyes!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE> is... my name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This voice is... <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―Before long, my mom came.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Ahh, <STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE>! Thank goodness!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom stroked my <STYLE ID="3" RUBY="ほお">cheek</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, I could hardly feel the touch of Mom's hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I realized that something like bandages was wrapped all over my face.<PG>
{MESOFF "0"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ギン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\古郡家居間死体.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "14" "200" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "見えない光_2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, it came back to me with a jolt.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The carnage at <STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s house, and <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, who had driven a knife into her throat to kill herself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But although I remember that much, I have no memory at all of what came after.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Was that really real?<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"Hey, when is it now!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　What month, what d...</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">Cough!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="2">cough...</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">hh..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I tried to raise my voice, but the back of my throat hurt and I could not speak properly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Today is April 9. You were asleep the whole night. It's 10:30 in the morning now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom was worried, but she put on a smile and answered.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"A whole night...? </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura... senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At that, Mom's face clouded a little.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Mom, why don't you tell her?</STYLE> <STYLE ID="1">You have to tell her, right? Surely by now..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Before Mom could answer, <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> started talking.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"Listen calmly. Everyone died, they say. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">The friend who came over yesterday</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">her mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">that senpai you love so much</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> too, and </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">her mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> as well..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then <STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> really did try to kill herself with the knife...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To protect me from the curse...?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="8">―</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> went on.<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"After that, the Kogori house caught fire, and they say </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> alone, the one in the entryway, were barely pulled out. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">Everyone else... the fire had already spread, and apparently the bodies are in a terrible state."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was a fire after that?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What does that mean? I don't understand... I don't understand any of it...<PG>
<STYLE ID="1">"And so, </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'re in this hospital now, that's the deal."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And before I had time to think,
{PLAYSND "SE\ノック.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
there was a knock on the hospital room door, which had been left open.<PG>
"Ooh, so you've come to."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had seen him before. The old-man-like detective I met at the police station yesterday.<PG>
"You're <STYLE ID="2">Erina Goto</STYLE>-san, aren't you. Last night must have been hard on you."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The detective spoke to me with a smile.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But hearing it, no feeling welled up in me at all.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I felt no tension and no annoyance, and that smile did not soften me.<PG>
"Sorry to bother you just as you've woken up, but there's something I'd like to ask."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With that, the detective began rummaging around in his bag.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Is this a formal statement?
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
<PG>
"This was found in <STYLE ID="2">your</STYLE> pocket, but does it mean anything to you?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the clear plastic bag the detective took out, there was something white and flat.<PG>
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">"Huh...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　Huh...!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What the detective showed me, it was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\新村春花.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "200" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\新村美冬.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "500" "C" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It was two paper figures.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And on the paper figures―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Haruka Niimura</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Mifuyu Niimura</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<BR>
Their surfaces were fouled with something like <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="としゃぶつ">vomit</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"I-I don't know..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was too frightened to say that I did know.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the first time I had seen the paper figures of the two of them, but I understand what this means.<PG>
"Is that so... By the way, this dirt-like stuff on the surface, it is actually <STYLE ID="5">Haruka Niimura-san</STYLE>'s―"<PG>
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1,アイテム2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\テーブル叩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="10">"I told you I don't know!!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I forgot the pain in my throat and shouted.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom and <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE> both froze where they stood at my voice, and the hospital room fell silent.<PG>
"My apologies. If that is how it is, that is fine. Well then, take care of yourself."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The detective left briskly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What is it... what is this...<PG>
"<STYLE ID="2">Erina</STYLE>, are you all right? Do you want something to drink?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Mom said that, but it did not get into my head.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\桃子バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"But, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Niimura-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'s father, yesterday was the anniversary of his death, right? And </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">that senpai you like</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> never knew that all this time? Isn't that strange?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="2">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="1">'d have noticed long ago, I'd think."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"<STYLE ID="1">Momoko</STYLE>... that is enough now."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Ahh... yeah, sorry, sorry."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>'s words gave me the final shock.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\キーン.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "$FFFFFF" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "12" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPS>Now that I think of it...
{PAUSE ""}
That time...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "明かされた真実.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "1000" "10000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花腕組み.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5"><TXSPN>"Yeah, I lived here in Motoki-cho until kindergarten, but it was Dad's work. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">3 years ago Dad finally got transferred overseas, so it became a posting away from the family. Just me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, we came back to this town."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Our moms were childhood friends, and through that we've been friends since we were old enough to remember. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">3 years ago, once it was settled that we would move back to Motoki-cho, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> told me, 'the place next door is empty'. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="5"> let me have my way, and we moved into the apartment we're in now."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\病院.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "14" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I see... So that was what it was...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I never noticed at all...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There were still so many things I had overlooked.<PG>
Why did I not notice something as simple as this?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I had noticed it then, my senpai might not have had to die.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I have stopped thinking.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A head that works too well is nothing but suffering.<PG>
So much for the genius girl. I want nothing more to do with that title.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't want to think about anything anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> was right. If everyone is dead, then... nothing matters anymore.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If they say it is a curse... then fine, let it be...<PG>
The Operation is... a failure.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPS>Through the open window of the hospital room,
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\花びら.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
cherry petals came fluttering in.<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
Mom... <STYLE ID="1">Sis</STYLE>...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Cherry blossoms are beautiful, aren't they.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
{MESOFF "3000"}
<EVENT VALUE="TEXTCLEAR">
<PG>
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CREATECG "エンド画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\lcm\ルートエンド.lcm" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
